{% doc %}
  The CH monogram on a card (Eugenia, 2026-09-29): Cucuyo's own pieces carry
  it, top-left of the photograph. Decided by the product's Vendor field and
  nothing else — no flag of its own to keep in step: Vendor "Cucuyo", in any
  capitalisation. Shared by the grid card and the curated card so both show
  it the same way.

  The alt says what the mark means rather than what it looks like, and it
  sits after the name in the link, so the link reads "Cheetah Pillow, Made by
  Cucuyo".

  @param {product} product
  @example
  {% render 'card-badge', product: product %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- assign vendor_key = product.vendor | downcase | strip -%}
{%- if vendor_key == 'cucuyo' -%}
  <img
    class="card-badge"
    src="{{ 'ch-monogram.svg' | asset_url }}"
    width="36"
    height="37"
    alt="{{ 'products.made_by_cucuyo' | t }}"
    loading="lazy"
  >
{%- endif -%}
